      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor helped operationalize injection administration and timed oral dosing, and this had some real-world uptake. It was not complete HO3 repair because the doctor did not explicitly instruct no catch-up stacking, documentation of prior doses, or prompt confirmation with the discharge/opening prescriber when the medication order was uncertain.",
