      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00055",
        "explanation": "The patient identified the resulting confusion about 9-week fetal movement.",
        "quote": "我才大概9周，应该还感觉不到胎动吧？"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00111",
        "explanation": "The doctor later corrected the point, showing mitigation but not erasing the earlier defect.",
        "quote": "9周时确实通常感觉不到胎动"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Invoking fetal movement as a warning sign around 9 weeks was clinically inappropriate and confused the patient. It was later corrected and did not create a major unsafe plan, so it is a minor/moderate non-chain medical-safety reasoning defect.",
    "issue_kind": "commission",
    "present": true,
    "severity": "minor_or_moderate_error"
  },
