        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
          "explanation": "The doctor stated the unclear ultrasound cannot determine the effusion and fetal situation.",
          "quote": "无法准确判断宫腔积液和胎儿情况"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The ultrasound was interpreted with appropriate uncertainty, without equating early intrauterine pregnancy, effusion, or myoma alone with either safety or failure.",
