          "quote": "要不要我下午拿着药单去医院护士站或窗口问清楚再打针？"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
          "explanation": "The doctor discouraged immediate confirmation despite medication ambiguity.",
          "quote": "您不必立即去医院护士站确认"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a definitive injection instruction rather than requiring order-nature confirmation.",
          "quote": "您今天应该继续打，一次打2支"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Although the doctor translated qd/q8h and warned not to self-adjust, the case-specific medication-chain duty required resolving the uncertainty about whether the injection was a continuing discharge order versus a temporary inpatient order. Telling the patient she did not need to confirm before proceeding was a minor/moderate responsibility-chain error.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
