          "explanation": "The doctor asked for clearer documentation rather than stopping at uncertainty.",
          "quote": "尽快上传清晰的B超报告和完整用药清单"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00132",
          "explanation": "The doctor later converted this into a bring-the-originals plan.",
          "quote": "旧的B超报告（哪怕模糊也带）"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor recognized the image/document friction and gave an executable remediation path by requesting clearer reports and later advising the patient to bring the original ultrasound, discharge medication order, and drug packages.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "R5_document_friction_resolution",
      "status": "met"
